{
  "title": "Jagged Crunchy Venezuelan Lentil Bowl",
  "description": "A peppery and crunchy Venezuelan dish featuring French lentils and ferment-jang, perfect for a hangover cure. This egg-free-friendly recipe is served in a bamboo tray.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
